span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7S0n5Q6QGTxOt7fcwvWhXybN8TpxQTsWIqk4txDp2XgxFEq4cQia7QoMrwoYNLTxCx8bYzLlaCFjxA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 12px;\">\n          亚马逊区域在秘鲁北边，是上图红色部分，图片来源CAFE IMPORTS网站\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n           关于蜂鸟农场\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;'>\n          Jose（侯赛）和家人来自于秘鲁亚马孙大区（Amazonas Department）亚蒙区（Yamon District）的埃尔帕尔托（El Palto），咖啡是这里所有家庭的主要经济来源。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          “蜂鸟”这个名字源于Jose 11岁时的一次神奇经历：一天，他正在休息，一只蜂鸟优雅地轻落在了他的头上——那一刻深深印在他的记忆中，对他的家人来说也具有深刻的精神意义——这促使他们以“蜂鸟”命名自己的农场。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TxUWnT3YJjXOAGyyE6KfHVYSvNTfd7NWiaq0zlFG1PIYVriccVcCcTkcIGu13sPicdlqJHptTRzEiaVg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          如今，Jose 已从父母手中接过了管理农场的重任，每当看到这些拥有绚丽羽毛的美丽蜂鸟依然造访庄园，他便知道，“蜂鸟”这个名字就是最完美的选择。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          在创立蜂鸟之初，Jose和家人就立志成为亚马逊地区精品咖啡生产的领先者。他们加入了当地一家倡导高品质咖啡生产的PROCECAM的合作社，从这里不断汲取有关品种、处理法的专业知识和经验分享。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TxUWnT3YJjXOAGyyE6KfHVhPJWBibWjdiaoIOxb4iaAdFshzP02nbb5fG5FS5JVnoKYU5rGpoJKXpqA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          蜂鸟农场的海拔在1800米，种有红瑰夏和黄瑰夏。2023年，农场将投产第二年的瑰夏送往第七届秘鲁CoE，获得了第12名的优异成绩，摘得了“CoE获奖豆”殊荣。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TxUWnT3YJjXOAGyyE6KfHVeiaicCd59scm0Uiaj3uxmic4IfVhia49dLkrjn6MbpJTdpRM8ulPLjbZRZQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TxUWnT3YJjXOAGyyE6KfHVPX7nFym3FM2icoIPrpX9LdZ59ao08Ce0jM9jc5AUasEPWMwgwxSUfdg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          本批次为蜂鸟农场专为2024年第八届秘鲁CoE所生产的参赛批次，该批次在比赛中取得了第39名的成绩。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           获奖记录\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          2023 Peru CoE #12\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
